{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>將軍澳39歲男浴室內暈倒，昏迷送院搶救不治。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (12 日 ) 凌晨 1 時 48 分，警方接獲一名女子報案，指發現其丈夫在將軍澳昭信路 11 號一單位浴室暈倒。人員接報到場，該名 39 歲姓劉男子昏迷被送往將軍澳醫院治理，其後被證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:20:09.842655+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:15:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:57:49.156138+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:17:44.100836+00:00","content_hash":"01f3ef55022b6dde0b719dd8a5120872a7ba62426f62e2741c08e897c3151f01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}